        "content": "## Explore traces\n\nOpen **Explore** and select **VictoriaTraces** to search distributed traces. Use the same `trace_id` in **VictoriaLogs** to correlate an application request across both data sources.\n\nUseful starter LogsQL queries:\n\n- `*` shows recent logs\n- `trace_id:=\"your-trace-id\"` finds one end-to-end request\n- `level:=\"ERROR\"` finds errors when the field is present",
